**Task Management API with Authentication**

We will use Node.js, Express.js, and MongoDB to create a REST API with authentication. We will also use JSON Web Tokens (JWT) for authentication.

### Dependencies

```bash
npm install express mongoose jsonwebtoken bcryptjs
```

### Database Setup

```javascript
// models/task.js
const mongoose = require('mongoose');

const taskSchema = new mongoose.Schema({
  task_id: String,
  title: String,
  priority: String,
  tags: [String],
  estimated_hours: Number,
  subtasks: [
    {
      id: String,
      description: String,
      done: Boolean
    }
  ]
});

const Task = mongoose.model('Task', taskSchema);

module.exports = Task;
```

